          </svg>
          <span>Bedrock.engineer</span>
        </div>

        <!-- <h1>Bridge subsurface data <br />and modern geospatial tools</h1> -->
        <h1>
          Visualize. <wbr />Integrate.<wbr /> Optimize. <br />Your Subsurface
          Data
        </h1>

        <!-- <p>
          Go from subsurface data stuck in gINT, AGS, or GEF to tools that make
          it accessible and useful. Surface your subsurface data in web maps,
          ArcGIS, QGIS, or AEC collaboration platforms.
        </p> -->

        <p class="md:text-lg">
          Surface your subsurface data in web maps, Python, QGIS, and AEC
          platforms, escape proprietary databases like gINT or industry-specific
          file formats like AGS and GEF.
        </p>

        <!-- <p>Go from subsurface data stuck in gINT, AGS, or GEF to web maps, ArcGIS, QGIS, and AEC collaboration platforms—accessible wherever you need it.</p> -->

        <!-- "Surface your subsurface data—go from gINT, AGS, and GEF files to web maps, ArcGIS, QGIS, and AEC platforms." -->

        <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap mt-12">
          <a
            href="https://cal.com/bedrock.engineer"
            class="cta-button-inverted"
            target="_blank"
          >
            Schedule Discovery Call
          </a>
          <a href="/demos" class="cta-button-secondary-inverted">View Demos</a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="header-controls">
        <Search />
        <ThemeToggle />
      </div>

      <section class="worked-with">
